    "legend": "Schematic overview of published duplications involving <em>GREM1</em> regulatory elements: transcription binding factor region in mauve, promoters in pale blue, enhancers in gold. The 16&nbsp;and 40&nbsp;kb duplications do not include any <em>GREM1</em> coding sequence; the 24&nbsp;kb variant duplicates <em>GREM1</em> exon&nbsp;1; and the 57&nbsp;kb variation constitutes a whole gene duplication. The smallest region of overlap, implying causation, thus includes an enhancer, a transcription factor binding site, and two promoters.",
